2026-10-10  Ole Kristian Aamot  <ole.aamot@aamotinnovation.com>

	* Release 0.5.0-pre.

	* src/camera.c, src/camera.h: New camera layer on libgphoto2.
	Replaces the built-in 0.4 drivers.  Numbered pictures over a
	recursive folder walk, range parsing, thumbnail fallback.

	* src/cli.c, src/cli.h: Command-line mode.  Keeps -n, -s, -t, -d
	from 0.4; adds -a, -l, -c, -u, --summary, --manual, --about,
	--html, --list-cameras, --list-ports.

	* src/gui.c, src/gui.h: GTK+ 3 main window with background
	thumbnail loading.

	* src/viewer.c, src/viewer.h: Picture viewer with rotate, flip,
	scale and zoom.

	* src/config-dialog.c, src/config-dialog.h: Camera settings.

	* src/html.c, src/html.h: HTML gallery export.

	* configure.ac, Makefile.am: Autotools build, --disable-gui.

	* data/org.gphoto.gPhoto.desktop, data/org.gphoto.gPhoto.svg:
	Desktop entry and icon.

	* doc/gphoto.1, doc/MANUAL: Documentation.
